                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The budget proposed by House Republicans would significantly underfund WIC. This would likely force eligible children and pregnant moms onto waiting lists, denying them vital nutrition benefits & WIC services that are critical for healthy development.",
