                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "WIC provides crucial nutrition assistance to pregnant and postpartum moms, children, and infants. It is unacceptable that tens of thousands of Oregonians could lose these benefits because House Republicans are threatening to shut down the government.",
