                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Many college students aren\u2019t aware that they may qualify for food assistance, and others fear stigma if they seek help. I created the Opportunity to Address College Hunger Act to help remove barriers to accessing SNAP and other nutrition programs. \nhttps://t.co/BVmZIzFigN",
