                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It would also cut education funding like Title I and IDEA, make dangerous cuts to nutrition programs like WIC and SNAP, slash resources for the 988 Suicide Lifeline, and cut funding for fighting the fentanyl crisis and wildfires.",
