                "text": "I also met with some line dancers at a class at the Neighborhood House senior center!  Classes like this help promote exercise and coordination, & provide a space for people to socialize.\n\nI\u2019ll continue to look for ways to support Neighborhood House & the Oregonians they serve. https://t.co/JQ269oFpmM",
